@meeting train.m13.halloran-emeka
// Pillar 5 Step 4, M13 leak hunting: Halloran when Torres is off. Seat E2.
title: Follow the wet
from: Emeka Halloran
gist: Emeka showed you leak hunting: read the puddle, follow the wet back to the joint, then tighten or replace it.
== lines
halloran-emeka: A drip somewhere. Lovely. Well, not lovely. You know what I mean.   [laugh]
halloran-emeka > you: Follow the wet. Listen too, mind. Drips talk.
halloran-emeka: Which way's the puddle running? Read it like a map. Wetter is closer.
halloran-emeka: Find the joint. Tighten it, or replace it if it's worn through. Off you go.
